      "text": "The docstring says that `permits_foreign_key_context` replays setup changes and no-ops, but the function only decides whether to permit a `foreign_keys` write, and it does not say why the permission is safe. Fix: say that the function permits `foreign_keys` writes during setup or inside an open transaction, because SQLite ignores the write inside a transaction and the setup-boundary check and per-statement readback still enforce the profile."
